    "nearest_train": "argmax cosine similarity over ALL train.csv images (866), not a label budget",
    "distance": "min Hamming over 8 orientations, symmetric (data.d8_distance), from splits/hashes.npz",
    "when": "eval.py computes the lists from test images and train features BEFORE it reads any test label, and saves them to results/test_strata.json",
    "validation_evidence": "VAL, same rule: near 35 images at 1-NN acc 1.000, clean 139 at 0.799. Replaced the hash-only rule (min distance to any train image), which did not separate val: near 124 at 0.847, clean 50 at 0.820."
